    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for the tip about the short cuts. I've been sharpening my chisels regularly, but maybe I need to go finer on the stones. Do you think the moisture content of the walnut could be playing a part in why it's so brittle at the tips? I'm worried the wood might be too dry for these fine details.",
